/mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
